{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/difc-heights-tower-difc","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":41,"crm_id":"4593","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"DIFC Heights Tower","slug":"difc-heights-tower-difc","display_address":"DIFC","building_type":["apartment","duplex"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"DIFC","price":2400000,"display_price":"2.4M","lattitude":25.198529,"longitude":55.3580669,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Developed by DIFC Development, DIFC Heights Tower is an architectural landmark presenting a curated collection of ultra-luxury residences, state-of-the-art amenities, and breathtaking views of the city’s most iconic landmarks. The second premium residential development from DIFC Living, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/difc/\">Dubai International Financial Centre</a> consists of 366 opulent residences, ranging from <strong>1- to 4-bedroom duplexes</strong>, each thoughtfully crafted with premium finishes and sweeping city views.</p><p>Residents will enjoy an elevated lifestyle with world-class amenities, including a temperature-controlled swimming pool, dedicated kids’ play areas, a fully equipped gym, family lounges, and co-working spaces. Surrounded by cultural landmarks such as the Museum of the Future and Burj Khalifa—and just a short walk from the Dubai Metro—DIFC Heights offers a vibrant fusion of luxury, convenience, and connectivity: a true centre stage for global living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/DIFC_Heights_Tower_by_DIFC_Development_1fd26a655a.jpg","hash":"DIFC_Heights_Tower_by_DIFC_Development_1fd26a655a","name":"DIFC Heights Tower by DIFC Development"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2